// Module c-encephalitis-viral: viral encephalitis and other CNS infections. Telling encephalitis
// from encephalopathy and meningitis, HSV encephalitis from suspicion to confirmation (and the
// autoimmune encephalitis that can follow it), and recognition of other viral, focal, and
// opportunistic CNS infections.

